Persona Training Lab — Original Creators

One Human
    The human creator, project owner, product decision-maker, integrator and
    holder/claimant of copyright interests to the extent copyright subsists in
    original project material and those interests are lawfully held by them.

One Neural Network
    The neural-network collaborator involved throughout the original project's
    architecture, design, implementation and review. This is a provenance
    designation. It does not assert that a neural network is a legal person or
    a copyright holder.

Project provenance statement
    This project was created by one human and one neural network.

The two designations above are intentionally anonymous. Later use of external
models, tools or reviewers does not alter this statement about the provenance
of the original project.
